<title>FRANCE: EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 305,061 tonnes of German intervention barley at a minimum price of 103.15 Ecus per tonne for export to non-EU countries, grain traders said.</p>
<p>The EU's cereals management committee also sold 52,892 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 100.06 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
